   "seed": 1851315659,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1938629691,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 ADR-003 made trials and documents source-agnostic, but the check still assumed CTIS and Bruckner et al.: its prompt names CTIS and the \"Summary of results (for\n   publication)\"; its questions (participants, cancelled, one per primary endpoint), their English search words and the rules for \"enough\" are code.\n\u2022 A trial's documents can now come from any source: a registry's results summary, a study report, a journal publication, an upload. Other standards (US FDAAA, CONSORT\n   for publications) ask for different things.\n\u2022 We want every check to record what was used at that moment: the trial record and document versions, the prompt, the requirements, every call and decision.\n\u2022 Nothing is in production yet: there is one current version of each prompt, rule and requirement set; only gold datasets are versioned (their labels must stay\n   comparable). Runs log the exact texts they used.",
   "originalText": "\u2022 ADR-003 made trials and documents source-agnostic, but the check still assumed CTIS and Bruckner et al.: its prompt names CTIS and the \"Summary of results (for\n   publication)\"; its questions (participants, cancelled, one per primary endpoint), their English search words and the rules for \"enough\" are code.\n\u2022 A trial's documents can now come from any source: a registry's results summary, a study report, a journal publication, an upload. Other standards (US FDAAA, CONSORT\n   for publications) ask for different things.\n\u2022 We want every check to record what was used at that moment: the trial record and document versions, the prompt, the requirements, every call and decision.\n\u2022 Nothing is in production yet: there is one current version of each prompt, rule and requirement set; only gold datasets are versioned (their labels must stay\n   comparable). Runs log the exact texts they used.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-context",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
